6-501.12 The following areas are in need of additional cleaning:
1) floor drain under the 3 part sink (buildup on grate and inside) - cleaned during inspection;
2) corner of floor at dish machine (buildup); and
3) floor under ice machine (debris/buildup); 
Clean in the aforementioned areas and throughout the kitchen daily/as needed to eliminate buildup.
Physical facilities shall be cleaned as often as necessary to keep them clean

6-501.12 Wall at dish machine was cleaned since the previous inspection, and general cleaning has occurred. The following areas are in need of additional cleaning:
1) floor drain under the 3 part sink (buildup on grate and inside);
2) corner of floor at dish machine (buildup); and
3) floor under ice machine (debris/buildup); 
Clean in the aforementioned areas and throughout the kitchen daily/as needed to eliminate buildup.
Physical facilities shall be cleaned as often as necessary to keep them clean

4-602.13 General surfaces throughout the kitchen are in need of cleaning, especially the following areas:
1) inside coolers (buildup on shelves/in bottom);
2) out of service prep cooler with spoiled foods (food spillage/debris) - cleaned during inspection;
3) inside all drawers and cabinets at counters in dining area (crumbs/splash/general debris accumulation);
4) counters under equipment in dining area (dust/debris);
5) waffle iron hinge and other general surfaces (grease)
6) inside metal storage cabinets labeled for coffee and cereal storage - bottom inside, shelves, and on inner surfaces of doors (general buildup/debris);
7) general surfaces around burners and flattop grill (carbon buildup/grease/food debris);  and
8) dish machine general surfaces (general buildup of debris/splash);
Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
